---
description: Next.js App Router conventions
globs: app/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---
- Server Components by default; "use client" only for state, effects, or browser events.
- Dynamic routes: type `params` as `Promise<{ slug: string }>` and await it.
- Use notFound() when a record is missing.
- Use generateStaticParams for CMS-backed dynamic routes.
- Add generateMetadata (title, description) to every page.
- Add loading.tsx / error.tsx only when asked.
